    <marc:datafield tag="520" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
      <marc:subfield code="a">When Moomintroll and Sniff find a message in a bottle down on the shore, it leads to an expedition to Lonely Island on a little raft. High winds and a storm at sea nearly lead to disaster but they are rescued by a new friend, the ever-resourceful Too-Ticky. Moomintroll&apos;s close friend, Snorkmaiden, is jealous but she soon learns that finding a new friend doesn&apos;t mean losing an old one. This is a magical picture book about the Moomins based on the art and characters created by Tove Jansson.</marc:subfield>
